The function handles potential errors gracefully, providing informative error messages that aid in debugging. It also includes comprehensive logging for the system's runtime behavior, including performance metrics and error occurrences, to facilitate monitoring and maintenance. The logging system supports real-time analysis and can export logs in various formats (e.g., JSON, CSV) for further processing.

Overall, this code provides a robust and efficient solution for managing transaction logging in a retail application, handling large volumes of concurrent transactions with minimal performance overhead and ensuring data integrity and reliability.']

