This code defines a function `manage_queue` that manages a queue of incoming sensor data streams, prioritizing data streams based on a dynamic priority threshold and maintaining a sliding window of the last 24 hours of data to calculate these averages. The function also includes mechanisms for detecting and handling duplicate data entries, robust logging, and asynchronous updates from multiple threads. Additionally, it integrates with an external data analytics module to process and analyze the data, providing insights into environmental trends and anomalies.']

